{"parse": {"title": "PCD-06", "pageid": 25843, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PCD-05\" title=\"PCD-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PCD-06</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PCD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.87.B4.E8.BF.9C.E6.98.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"致远星\">致远星</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 致远星</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">To The Distant Stars</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>蛋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>奶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>调<span class=\"color-value\"></span>和<span class=\"color-value\"></span>物<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>酒<span class=\"color-value\"></span>精<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>童<span class=\"color-value\"></span>特<span class=\"color-value\"></span>饮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>刻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>唯<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>选<span class=\"color-value\"></span>择<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190506</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"0xiangzinei\"><img alt=\"0xiangzinei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/600px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/900px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/Cg-0xiangzinei.png/1200px-Cg-0xiangzinei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>天啊！你们居然经历了这么惊险又刺激的故事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>要是我也跟着去了该有多好呀，那里的人们一定没见过苏芙比特制魔药，我的魔药会大受欢迎——然后我也能出现在电视机里啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>如果你也跟着来了，我想事情一定会变得更加混乱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>应该说更有趣才对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>当然了！因为苏芙比是个“有趣”的淑女！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>——我回来了，大家凑在一起是在聊什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>啊！兔耳朵姐姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>雾行者和X先生正在和我讲你们的冒险故事呢，上周的那些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>哦，是、是的！那是个精彩而惊险的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>对了，关于那件事！星之眼先生，我有东西要交给你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>星之眼先生？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>星之眼先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>嗯，嗯——？什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>我在外面看到了这个……我想你会感兴趣的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芭妮芭妮从背包中拿出了一叠报纸。<br />从日期来看，距离上次探险正好过去了一周。<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>“本地UFO事件已引起了全国范围的注意，负责追捕的警探威廉姆斯先生曾多次与不明飞行物近距离接触……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“威廉姆斯先生曾为第九区特派调查组的成员，经此一战让他名声大噪，多家媒体声称要为其提供专访。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“但他本人似乎并无此意，并在上周五下午对警署提交了辞呈。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>真让人意想不到。他追在我们身后，追得那么紧，那么急，我还以为他一定真诚地热爱着这份工作，期待着干出一番事业呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>虽然我不该说这句话……但这毫无疑问是一个出人头地的好机会。他为什么会放弃这个机会？我不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>因为那是他该做的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>我们约好了的。 </div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>约好？星之眼先生，你和这个警官认识吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>我们是朋友。<br />……很好的朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>朋友？天，我可没看出来，你们还有这种关系……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>什么，什么？什么朋友……你们不是说，那个警官一直想要抓住你们吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>这下我又听不懂了……<br />这个故事简直比莫桑小姐看的那些爱情小说还错综复杂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>我们认识得并不久。我们只是短暂地聊过……聊过一些事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>兔耳朵姑娘，谢谢你给我这个。我会好好留着它的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">芭妮芭妮：</div><div>哦，好的，如果这能让你开心点的话，请拿去吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>归根到底，还是没人能搞懂星之眼与威廉姆斯之间是如何诞生友情，又如何相互追逃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星之眼不再忧愁，不再若有所思。<br />他在大部分时间内看起来和平常没什么差别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他仍旧热情洋溢地称呼所有人为“我亲爱的人类朋友”，满口说着容易被拆穿的谎言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在那之后，星之眼也离开过几次行李箱。<br />与第一次不同，他很小心，没有被任何人发现行踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那间破旧的公寓还没有新租客，信箱中总是塞着新的明信片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>明信片里说，威廉姆斯回到了自己堪萨斯州的家，他在夕阳下拥抱自己的女儿，亲吻自己的妻子。他对她们坦承自己的懦弱，并得到原谅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再之后，他们一起制作那些果酱和腌黄瓜。<br />开上一间家庭作坊，过上幸福的生活。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Cg-1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_xingzhiyanxiyang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>“书包嘴叔叔”最经典的曲目——最适合如此美好的、美好的黄昏的曲目！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>虽然搭配嘟嘟鸟蛋酒没有那么合适，但，总归也比没有酒好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>永远的祝福你快乐而健康，敬我亲爱的人类朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星之眼向着空气干杯，属于朋友的爵士乐搭配美酒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>敬星云！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>敬太阳黑子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>敬虫洞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星之眼：</div><div>敬远星旅行者！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png 2